'''Wintery Basin''' is a [[:Category:Difficulty 1|Difficulty 1]] fishing game.

==[[Collections]]==
*Snowhill Pond Fish
*Snowhill Stream Fish
*Extra Large Catch of the Day

==Types of Fish==
*Frozen Char - Catchable at level 1
*Winter Piranha - Catchable at level 1
*Frostgill Smelt - Catchable at level 5
*Spineless Stickleback - Catchable at level 10
*Blubracuda - Catchable at level 14
*Coach Loach - Catchable at level 17
*Ferocious Fangler - Catchable at level 20
